{"a":[31,31],"h":"<p>31.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 40.4 40.4 49.4 60.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 49.4 60.7 69.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve işte böyle - ya Muhammed, sana yaptığımız gibi <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"289\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 289.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 48.0 48.0 60.7 60.7 69.7 69.7 77.3 93.0 103.6 103.6 119.3 126.0 126.0 126.0 134.3 134.3 143.3 161.3 161.3 161.3 172.6 172.6 179.3 195.0 195.0 195.0 205.6 205.6 217.6 217.6 234.0 240.7 247.6 247.6 254.3 261.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 93.0 143.3 179.3 240.7 254.3 261.0 273.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her Peygamber için de mücrimlerden düşman yaptık - ve binaenaleyh sen de onlar gibi sabret, onları kahretmek için <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"222\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 221.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.7 37.6 37.6 51.7 58.6 75.7 82.6 82.6 89.3 89.3 96.7 103.6 121.6 138.0 138.0 138.0 144.7 152.3 152.3 168.0 179.3 179.3 186.0 197.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.7 58.6 103.6 121.6 144.7 186.0 197.3 205.6\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> yolu gösterecek, yardım edecek de rabbın yeter. 32. </p>"}